{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[vocal]] [[cord]]}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} Either of two pairs of folds of [[mucous membrane]] stretched horizontally across the human [[larynx]] whose vibrations help to produce the voice.

====Synonyms====
* [[vocal band]]
* [[plica vocalis]]

====Derived terms====
* [[false vocal cord]]
* [[true vocal cord]]

